# SoccerSim — Cursor Rules

## Single Source of Truth
For all project conventions, build commands, quirks, and verification protocol, see `CLAUDE.md` in the project root. That file is authoritative.

## Cursor-Specific
- This project uses Claude Code (via Cursor extension) with GLM-5.1 through Z.AI API
- The MCP bridge (soft-ue-cli) is configured in `.mcp.json` — do not modify
- Superpowers plugin is active — follow its workflow skills (brainstorming → planning → execution)
